#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:2
msgid "Agent Skills（智能体技能）"
msgstr "Agent Skills"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:27
msgid "设计目标"
msgstr "Design Goals"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:29
msgid "**按需加载**：降低每步不必要的上下文占用与执行开销。"
msgstr ""
"**On-demand loading**: Reduces unnecessary context usage and execution overhead at "
"each step."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:30
msgid "**可解释选择**：选择依据来自 catalog 中的简短描述，便于调试和复盘。"
msgstr ""
"**Interpretable selection**: Selection is based on short descriptions in the catalog,"
" facilitating debugging and review."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:31
msgid "**热更新友好**：支持运行时扫描、激活/停用与重载（自定义 skill 放进 ``custom/skills/`` 即被发现）。"
msgstr ""
"**Hot-update friendly**: supports runtime scanning, activation/deactivation, and "
"reloading; custom skills are discovered when placed under ``custom/skills/``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:32
msgid "**文件约定解耦**：技能通过 workspace 文件交换状态，而不是互相直接调用。"
msgstr ""
"**File-convention decoupling**: Skills exchange state through workspace files rather "
"than calling each other directly."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:33
msgid ""
"**分级执行**：内置技能的 ``entrypoint`` 进程内直调（避免子进程启动；脚本仍需满足并发安全约束）；自定义 / 环境技能经 "
"``skill_worker.py`` 子进程隔离执行，隔离进程内状态；文件与环境工具的副作用仍需由技能自身管理。"
msgstr ""
"**Tiered execution**: built-in ``entrypoint`` functions run in-process and must "
"follow concurrency constraints. Custom/environment skills run through "
"``skill_worker.py`` subprocesses, isolating process-local state; skills still manage "
"their own file and environment-tool effects."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:38
msgid "Skill 目录结构"
msgstr "Skill Directory Structure"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:36
msgid ""
"内置技能位于 ``agentsociety2/agent/skills/``，自定义技能位于工作区 "
"``custom/skills/``，环境模块技能由环境提供。``SkillRegistry`` 按目录扫描，用 ``namespace@name`` 作为稳定 ``skill_id``。"
msgstr ""
"Built-in skills live under ``agentsociety2/agent/skills/``; custom skills live under workspace "
"``custom/skills/``; environment-module skills are provided by the environment. ``SkillRegistry`` "
"scans directories and uses ``namespace@name`` as the stable ``skill_id``."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# 内置技能（命名空间 built-in）\n"
"agentsociety2/agent/skills/\n"
"└── daily-guidance/\n"
"    ├── SKILL.md            # frontmatter（name/description/script/hooks）+ 行为说明\n"
"    ├── scripts/\n"
"    │   └── daily_guidance.py\n"
"    └── references/\n"
"\n"
"# 自定义技能（命名空间 custom，热加载）\n"
"{workspace}/custom/skills/\n"
"└── my-skill/\n"
"    ├── SKILL.md\n"
"    └── scripts/\n"
"        └── my_skill.py\n"
"\n"
"# 环境模块技能（命名空间 env）\n"
"{env_module}/skills/\n"
"└── weather-query/\n"
"    └── SKILL.md"
msgstr ""
"# Built-in skills (built-in namespace)\n"
"agentsociety2/agent/skills/\n"
"└── daily-guidance/\n"
"    ├── SKILL.md            # Frontmatter (name/description/script/hooks) and behavior "
"instructions\n"
"    ├── scripts/\n"
"    │   └── daily_guidance.py\n"
"    └── references/\n"
"\n"
"# Custom skills (custom namespace, hot-loaded)\n"
"{workspace}/custom/skills/\n"
"└── my-skill/\n"
"    ├── SKILL.md\n"
"    └── scripts/\n"
"        └── my_skill.py\n"
"\n"
"# Environment module skills (env namespace)\n"
"{env_module}/skills/\n"
"└── weather-query/\n"
"    └── SKILL.md"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:65
msgid ""
"扫描规则：每个子目录必须含 ``SKILL.md``，否则跳过；以 ``.`` 或 ``_`` 开头的目录被忽略；同名（同 ``skill_id``）先到先得。agent"
" 启动时通过 ``default_activated_skill_ids`` 配置默认激活哪些 skill。"
msgstr ""
"Scan rules: each subdirectory must contain ``SKILL.md`` or it is skipped; directories"
" starting with ``.`` or ``_`` are ignored; duplicate names (same ``skill_id``) are "
"first-wins. At agent startup, ``default_activated_skill_ids`` configures which skills"
" are activated by default."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:70
msgid "SKILL.md 格式"
msgstr "SKILL.md Format"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:72
msgid "每个 skill 目录必须含 ``SKILL.md``，头部用 YAML frontmatter 描述元数据："
msgstr ""
"Each skill directory must contain a ``SKILL.md`` file. The file header uses YAML "
"frontmatter to describe metadata:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:69
msgid ""
"---\n"
"name: daily-guidance\n"
"description: 强制使用：凡是时间尺度在小时及以下的日常行为模拟，必须使用本 Skill ...\n"
"script: scripts/daily_guidance.py\n"
"hooks:\n"
"  pre_step: scripts/daily_guidance.py\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"# Daily Guidance\n"
"\n"
"（激活后被注入 system prompt 的行为说明……）"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"name: daily-guidance\n"
"description: Mandatory for daily behavior simulations with time scales of one hour or less ...\n"
"script: scripts/daily_guidance.py\n"
"hooks:\n"
"  pre_step: scripts/daily_guidance.py\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"# Daily Guidance\n"
"\n"
"(Behavior instructions injected into the system prompt after activation...)"

