#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:99
msgid "**目录描述**——选择阶段 LLM 唯一可见的文本，决定是否激活。务必精炼、可操作。"
msgstr ""
"**Catalog description**: the only text visible to the LLM during selection, and what "
"determines whether it activates the skill. Keep it concise and actionable."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:100
msgid "``script``"
msgstr "``script``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:101
