#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:103
msgid "可选，生命周期 hook 脚本映射，键为 hook 类型（``pre_step`` / ``post_step``），值为相对脚本路径。"
msgstr ""
"Optional lifecycle hook script mapping. Keys are hook types (``pre_step`` / "
"``post_step``), and values are relative script paths."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:107
msgid ""
"frontmatter 之后的 Markdown 正文，是 skill 被 **激活后** 注入 system prompt 的行为说明（原样注入 "
"``<skill_content>`` 块，不做任何占位符替换或命令注入）。未激活时不进上下文。"
msgstr ""
"The Markdown body after the frontmatter is the behavior description injected into the"
" system prompt when the skill is **activated** (rendered verbatim into the "
"``<skill_content>`` block, with no placeholder substitution or command injection). It"
" never enters the context while inactive."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:112
msgid "可见性与激活"
msgstr "Visibility and Activation"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:114
msgid "**可见（visible）**：skill 出现在目录里，LLM 能看到、能选择激活。"
msgstr ""
"**Visible**: the skill appears in the catalog, so the LLM can see it and choose to "
"activate it."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:115
msgid "**激活（activated）**：skill 的 ``SKILL.md`` 正文被注入 system prompt，其脚本 / hook 可被调用。"
msgstr ""
"**Activated**: the body of the skill's ``SKILL.md`` is injected into the system "
"prompt, and its scripts / hooks can be called."

