#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:134
msgid "ReAct 主循环每个 ``step()`` 开始前会刷新可见 skill 集合；``ask`` 模式（外部问答）下只暴露只读工具子集。"
msgstr ""
"Before each ``step()``, the main ReAct loop refreshes the visible skill set. In "
"``ask`` mode for external Q&A, only the read-only tool subset is exposed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:138
msgid "脚本执行模型（按信任级分流）"
msgstr "Script Execution by Trust Level"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:140
msgid "内置技能使用进程内调用，自定义技能使用独立 worker 子进程。两条路径共用 ``entrypoint(argv, ctx)`` 契约："
msgstr ""
"Built-in skills run in-process; custom skills use a separate worker subprocess. Both "
"paths share the ``entrypoint(argv, ctx)`` contract:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:137
msgid ""
"built-in 技能（可信，进程内热路径）:\n"
"  ① 原生 hook 函数              ← hook 脚本顶层定义同名无参函数（如 pre_step）时直接调用\n"
"  ② entrypoint(argv, ctx)       ← 缓存 import 后进程内调用；实现需自行保证并发安全\n"
"  ③ 子进程（python script.py）  ← 无 entrypoint 时的回退\n"
"\n"
"custom / env 技能（不可信，子进程隔离）:\n"
"  ① skill_worker.py 单次子进程  ← 提供 entrypoint 或原生 hook 函数时，worker 导入并只调用该函数\n"
"  ② 子进程（python script.py）  ← 无任何可调用函数时的回退，仅使用环境变量白名单"
msgstr ""
"built-in skills (trusted, in-process hot path):\n"
"  ① Native hook function              <- Calls a top-level zero-argument hook such as pre_step\n"
"  ② entrypoint(argv, ctx)             <- Cached import and in-process call; must be concurrency-"
"safe\n"
"  ③ Subprocess (python script.py)      <- Fallback when no entrypoint is defined\n"
"\n"
"custom / env skills (untrusted, isolated subprocesses):\n"
"  ① Single skill_worker.py subprocess  <- Imports and invokes the supplied entrypoint or native "
"hook\n"
"  ② Subprocess (python script.py)      <- Fallback without a callable; uses an environment "
"allowlist"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:153
#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:186
msgid "要点："
msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:150
msgid ""
"``entrypoint`` / hook 函数契约不变：无论进程内还是 worker 子进程，``entrypoint(argv, ctx)`` 的签名与 "
"``ctx.workspace_root`` 等上下文都保持一致，skill 作者按同一契约编写即可。"
msgstr ""
"The ``entrypoint`` / hook-function contract is unchanged: whether in-process or in the worker "
"subprocess, the ``entrypoint(argv, ctx)`` signature and context fields such as "
"``ctx.workspace_root`` stay the same, so skill authors write against a single contract."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:152
msgid ""
"**隔离而非就地执行**：自定义 / 环境技能即使提供 ``entrypoint`` 或原生 hook 函数，也在 ``skill_worker.py`` "
"启动的**单次子进程**中执行——每次调用独立导入模块，启动和导入计入超时；跨调用状态应写入 workspace，不要依赖模块全局变量。该子进程保留宿主 ``os.environ`` "
"（SDK、代理等配置可用）并叠加技能上下文（``SKILL_ID`` / ``SKILL_NAME`` / ``SKILL_DIR`` / ``AGENT_WORK_DIR``）。"
msgstr ""
"**Isolation over in-place execution**: even when a custom / environment skill provides "
"``entrypoint`` or a native hook function, it still runs in a **fresh subprocess** spawned by "
"``skill_worker.py`` — each call imports the module anew, and startup plus import time counts "
"toward the timeout; persist cross-call state to the workspace instead of relying on module "
"globals. The subproces"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:162
msgid "**结构化返回**：worker 把函数返回值按 stdout 约定结构化返回；技能自身的 ``print`` 输出转入 stderr，不会污染结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Structured returns**: the worker returns the function's return value over stdout "
"following a structured convention; the skill's own ``print`` output is redirected to "
"stderr and never pollutes the result."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:157
msgid ""
"旧的“动态包装器”（无 ``entrypoint`` 时以 ``__name__ == \"__main__\"`` 就地 ``exec`` 脚本）已在 v2.10.0 删除；无 "
"``entrypoint`` 的脚本一律走子进程，超时后可终止且不改变父进程状态。"
msgstr ""
"The old \"dynamic wrapper\" (executing the script in place via ``__name__ == \"__main__\"`` when "
"no ``entrypoint`` existed) was removed in v2.10.0; scripts without ``entrypoint`` always run as "
"subprocesses, can be terminated on timeout, and never mutate parent-process state."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:169
msgid "entrypoint 契约（推荐所有 skill 脚本遵循）"
msgstr "entrypoint Contract: Recommended for All Skill Scripts"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:171
msgid "Skill 脚本可在模块顶层定义一个 ``entrypoint``，runtime（内置进程内直调；自定义经 ``skill_worker.py``）会优先调用它："
msgstr ""
"A skill script may define an ``entrypoint`` at module top level; the runtime calls it"
" first (in-process for built-ins, via ``skill_worker.py`` for custom skills):"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:166
msgid ""
"def entrypoint(argv: list[str], ctx) -> str:\n"
"    \"\"\"技能入口。\n"
"\n"
"    Args:\n"
"        argv: 命令行参数（去掉脚本名之后的部分），与子进程方式的 sys.argv[1:] 一致。\n"
"        ctx:  SkillScriptContext，携带本 agent 的运行上下文。\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"        str: 脚本原本会打印到 stdout 的文本（通常是 YAML/JSON 结果块）。\n"
"    \"\"\""
msgstr ""
"def entrypoint(argv: list[str], ctx) -> str:\n"
"    \"\"\"Skill entry point.\n"
"\n"
"    Args:\n"
"        argv: Command arguments without the script name, matching sys.argv[1:] in subprocess "
"mode.\n"
"        ctx:  SkillScriptContext carrying this agent's runtime context.\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"        str: Text normally printed to stdout, typically YAML or JSON.\n"
"    \"\"\""

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:180
msgid "**签名兼容**：runtime 检测形参数量，``entrypoint(argv)`` 与 ``entrypoint(argv, ctx)`` 都支持，强烈建议接受 ``ctx``。"
msgstr ""
"**Signature compatibility**: the runtime detects arity, supporting both ``entrypoint(argv)`` and "
"``entrypoint(argv, ctx)``. Accepting ``ctx`` is strongly recommended."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:190
msgid "**返回 stdout**：不要依赖 ``print`` 被 capture；直接 ``return`` 结果字符串。"
msgstr ""
"**Return stdout**: do not rely on captured ``print`` output; directly ``return`` the "
"result string."

