msgid ""
"hook 脚本有两种形态：脚本形式以 ``--args-json`` 形式接收 payload（含 ``hook_type`` / ``tick`` / ``time`` / "
"``agent_id`` / ``step_count``）；**推荐**的函数形式则是在顶层定义同名无参函数、经 ``get_hook_context()`` 读取 "
"payload（见上文“原生 hook 函数快速路径”）。**改版后**，``pre_step`` 的输出渲染为专用的 ``<skill_hooks>`` XML 分块，出现在 ReAct 首条"
" user 消息中——而不是被塞进通用 observation dump（那容易被 LLM 忽略）。例如："
msgstr ""
"Hook scripts come in two forms: the script form receives its payload via ``--args-json`` "
"(including ``hook_type`` / ``tick`` / ``time`` / ``agent_id`` / ``step_count``); the "
"**recommended** function form defines a same-named parameterless function at top level and reads "
"the payload through ``get_hook_context()`` (see \"Native hook-function fast path\" above). "
"**After the redesign**, ``pre_step`` output is rendered as a dedicated ``<skill_hooks>`` XML "
"block in the first ReAct user message, rather than being buried in a generic observation dump "
"that the LLM can easily ignore. For example:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agent_skills.rst:327
